intl: internationalization with ICU of the package az (collation,
number and date formats, normalization, transliteration).

The module intl of PHP 8.3 for php83 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20230831/intl.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php83/conf.d, its headers in
include/php83/php/ext/intl.
